+# turns, crown when margin − 2.6·SE > δ on two consecutive looks, futility stop,
+# else the full slice). Counterfactual on the last 40 Qwen-ref verdicts: parity
+# 40/40 at the old knobs; bundle flips 1/40 (chal-00662's crown → +0.14 < δ, the
